{"title": "Venomous Bite (Spider Wild Shape)", "pageid": 1214, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Venomous_Bite_(Spider_Wild_Shape)", "categories": ["Actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Venomous_Bite_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Venomous Bite (disambiguation)\">Venomous Bite (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Venomous_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp/300px-Venomous_Bite.webp, /w/images/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp/300px-Venomous_Bite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Venomous Bite</b> is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Spider\" title=\"Wild Shape: Spider\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape: Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Wild_Shape_Spider_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Spider\" title=\"Wild Shape: Spider\">Wild Shape: Spider</a> Action. Spiders use this ability to make a melee attack that deals Piercing Damage to enemies and potentially Poisons them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Bite a target to deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d8 + Dexterity Modifier</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage and possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poison</a> it. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></span> </dd>  <dt>Damage:</dt>\n<dd> <div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d8 (1~8) + <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_score_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability score modifier\"> Dexterity  modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></span> </div></dd>       <dt> Details: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Unarmed Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Unarmed <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> </dd><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft) </dd><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13) </dd>\n</dl>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_Higher_Levels\">At Higher Levels</span></h2>\n<ul><li>At Level 4, this attack deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>At Level 8, this additional damage becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>.</li>\n<li>At Level 12, this additional damage becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Poisoned\">Condition: Poisoned</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Suffers <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg